# Org decision #26 / TDS 9 determinism: the committed SBoB profiles and their
# sidecars (sbob/**), the grammar lock, and the sbobforge configs are compared
# byte-for-byte by the drift gates (generate --check compares the working-tree
# text with the emitted text; the profiles embed the lock hash). git's
# autocrlf rewrites line endings on Windows checkouts, which would fail every
# drift gate on a windows runner before it even starts (found dogfooding the
# choco lane, PR #152; the SBOB-Forge side pins *.grammar and the catalogs the
# same way). Byte-identical checkouts on every platform: no conversion, ever.
sbob/** -text
sbobforge.lock.json -text
sbobforge.json -text
sbobforge-choco.json -text
